  "body": "## What's Changed\n* test(release): harden 0.13.3 release reliability by @Shishir435 in https://github.com/Shishir435/ollama-client/pull/320\n* refactor: enforce cognitive complexity ceiling by @Shishir435 in https://github.com/Shishir435/ollama-client/pull/321\n* feat: route embeddings through background RPC by @Shishir435 in https://github.com/Shishir435/ollama-client/pull/328\n* refactor: route shared embeddings through service by @Shishir435 in https://github.com/Shishir435/ollama-client/pull/329\n* Improve agentic readiness by @Shishir435 in https://github.com/Shishir435/ollama-client/pull/330\n* fix(ci): isolate coverage workers by @Shishir435 in https://github.com/Shishir435/ollama-client/pull/331\n* fix(embeddings): harden cache identity by @Shishir435 in https://github.com/Shishir435/ollama-client/pull/332\n* fix(embeddings): propagate cancellation end to end by @Shishir435 in https://github.com/Shishir435/ollama-client/pull/333\n* refactor(embeddings): close ownership boundaries by @Shishir435 in https://github.com/Shishir435/ollama-client/pull/334\n* perf: add evidence benchmarks by @Shishir435 in https://github.com/Shishir435/ollama-client/pull/335\n* perf: tune embedding batches and search-cache retention by @Shishir435 in https://github.com/Shishir435/ollama-client/pull/336\n* feat(web-search): add native search routing by @Shishir435 in https://github.com/Shishir435/ollama-client/pull/339\n* fix(tools): remove misleading selected_text tool by @Shishir435 in https://github.com/Shishir435/ollama-client/pull/340\n* refactor(tooling): organize scripts and unify verification by @Shishir435 in https://github.com/Shishir435/ollama-client/pull/341\n* feat(olc): add native Ollama lifecycle by @Shishir435 in https://github.com/Shishir435/ollama-client/pull/342\n* docs: polish release notes and layout by @Shishir435 in https://github.com/Shishir435/ollama-client/pull/344\n* chore: merge preview into release/0.13.3 by @Shishir435 in https://github.com/Shishir435/ollama-client/pull/346\n* fix(olc): give the macOS app time to finish quitting by @Shishir435 in https://github.com/Shishir435/ollama-client/pull/347\n* fix(release): publish the install wrappers with checksums by @Shishir435 in https://github.com/Shishir435/ollama-client/pull/348\n* docs: lead the install with the verified path by @Shishir435 in https://github.com/Shishir435/ollama-client/pull/349\n* Release 0.13.3 by @Shishir435 in https://github.com/Shishir435/ollama-client/pull/345\n* release 0.13.3 by @Shishir435 in https://github.com/Shishir435/ollama-client/pull/350\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Shishir435/ollama-client/compare/0.13.2...0.13.3",
